WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:01.700
Hi there!

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:02.480
Who are you?

3
00:00:03.101 --> 00:00:04.001
I'm a clown fish.

4
00:00:04.041 --> 00:00:06.262
We are very colorful fish!

5
00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:11.943
Where do you live?

6
00:00:28.992 --> 00:00:31.113
Clown fish live in the ocean.

7
00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:34.575
We like warm water.

8
00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:38.118
We swim near rocks and reefs.

9
00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.060
What do you eat?

10
00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:45.442
Clown fish eat lots of plants.

11
00:00:47.223 --> 00:00:49.665
We also eat tiny animals.

12
00:00:52.086 --> 00:00:53.147
What's behind you?

13
00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.680
That's a sea anemone.

14
00:01:03.622 --> 00:01:05.282
Some fish are afraid of them.

15
00:01:06.703 --> 00:01:07.723
But I'm not!

16
00:01:10.064 --> 00:01:11.804
You like anemones?

17
00:01:14.185 --> 00:01:16.426
Yes. We help each other.

18
00:01:17.926 --> 00:01:19.846
Clown fish live with anemones.

19
00:01:21.787 --> 00:01:23.748
They protect us from enemies.

20
00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:31.633
How do clown fish help anemones?

21
00:01:32.933 --> 00:01:34.914
Clown fish clean anemones.

22
00:01:36.414 --> 00:01:38.214
We chase their enemies away.

23
00:01:40.155 --> 00:01:41.935
And we share our food.

24
00:01:44.376 --> 00:01:46.797
Do all clown fish look like you?

25
00:01:48.257 --> 00:01:51.078
No. Clown fish have different colors.

26
00:01:52.898 --> 00:01:54.439
Some have different patterns.

27
00:01:55.699 --> 00:01:58.280
Look. I have three white stripes!

28
00:02:03.997 --> 00:02:04.478
Oh no!

29
00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:06.382
The anemone needs help.

30
00:02:07.865 --> 00:02:11.533
Good-bye! Good-bye,
